      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_7",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Harper",
            unit: "Harper",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Helicrom",
            unit: "Helicrom",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("There be it. The stronghold of Halstead."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 19,
            y: 13,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("Look at how tall it is! Those towers be so sheer and smooth, it almost looks like magic called them up out of the earth!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Aye, there may be some truths in that. Old stories tells us that in times past, Elensefar and Weldyn had some real strong mages, much more adept than them ones who only be politicking nowadays. They helped tame the lands between the cities and forged the walls of Halstead itself to honor the alliance."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("I don’t see how we can bring it down. They seem invincible in there!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Indeed..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Helicrom",
            text: _("Worry not, Halstead has a weakness. What Baldras spoke was partly true. Previous orders of magi did help erect the fortress. What is not made known to most is that the original construction of the castle was flawed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Helicrom",
            text: _("These walls were raised over a system of catacombs, which connect the four towers to the central keep. Though they appear impressive, the tunnels were never meant to hold up such a tremendous weight. Supports were added later to hold up the middle, which eventually began to collapse without them. Naturally, this was made secret by the magi, who did not want others to learn of their error."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("So... we can knock out the supports and bring down the main keep. Would it really work?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Helicrom",
            text: _("I believe it will. Each tower has a passage down to the catacombs. We must enter the tunnels and demolish all four supports, then the fortress should crumble."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Let’s hope you be right. Everything be hinging on this battle."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_side",
            equals: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vashna",
            text: _("Dommel! The Queen has sent me and my warriors to support your forces. We come to squash the puny peasant rebellion."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dommel",
            text: _("I received no word from Her Majesty of your arrival, orc."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vashna",
            text: _("I have the orders right here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dommel",
            text: _("As if those could possibly be real. I would be a fool and an oaf to let a band of stinky raider orcs into Halstead without a fight."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vashna",
            text: _("What? Now look here, you coddled pinkskin. Your helpless ‘soldiers’ have been getting bested by a filthy bunch of vagrant bandits. Your army is as useless as you are pink. The Queen sent us here to clean up the mess that you are clearly too stupid to fix on your own."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dommel",
            text: _("A fine story. Most likely, this is a pitiful excuse for you to enter our fortress to plunder our armory. Even if Her Majesty did order you here, we have no need for the help of you uncouth orcs. We have always managed just fine without you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vashna",
            text: _("Yeah? Well, we will see how fine you manage <i>against</i> us. I’ll show you just how weak you pinkskins are."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dommel",
            text: _("Come try it, cretin."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Helicrom",
            text: _("Infighting among the forces of Weldyn does not bode well for the new queen, but is awfully convenient for us..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_9",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 8,
